Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||08-31-2001||09:50 AM||||I kept my trim black, but when I get it painted agian, I will either have the trim painted black, or the color of the car. The stock finish of the trim is fading a bit much for me. I had worried originally about painting the trim- figured it would chip off easily. But from what I've read here, that isn't a concern as long as the trim is prepped (sanded) correctly before painting.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
